## 2. STRICT DIRECTORY ROUTING (ANTI-CLUTTER POLICY)
All generated files MUST adhere to the directory routing matrix:
- Proposals: `docs/00-presale-proposal/`
- Basic Design: `docs/01-basic-design/`
- Detail Design: `docs/02-detail-design/`
- Backlog & Roadmap: `backlog/` and `specs/ROADMAP.md`
- Feature Specs: `specs/[epic-id]/` (`spec.md`, `plan.md`, `tasks.md`, `deltas/`)
- Source Code: `src/` (Clean Architecture: Domain, Application, Infrastructure, Presentation, WebApp)
- Test Suites: `tests/` (`unit/`, `integration/`, `e2e/`)

## 3. WORKFLOW COMMANDS
- `/wf-presale`: Presale proposal & WBS/TCO estimation.
- `/wf-kickoff`: Kickoff, Basic Design & Master Roadmap.
- `/wf-autopilot [epic-id]`: Full-cycle autonomous development across 5 Stage-Gates.
- `/wf-delta [cr-id]`: Non-destructive Change Request via Delta Ledger.
- `/wf-hotfix [bug-id]`: Emergency surgical bug fix (Red test -> Zero regression).
- `/wf-audit`: Full architecture, Zero-Mock & traceability audit.
